"},{"type":"p","text":"AI agents will increasingly generate routine application code, tests, documentation and infrastructure configurations. The value of developers will increasingly shift toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem definition"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"System design"},{"text":"Verification"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Data design"},{"text":"Product understanding"},{"text":"Complex debugging"},{"text":"Technical decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest developers will become software-system designers and problem solvers, not simply code typists."},{"type":"h","text":"Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Structures & Algorithms"},{"text":"OOP"},{"text":"SQL & Databases"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Backend Development"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Frontend Fundamentals"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"Docker/CI-CD"},{"text":"System Design"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"AI/ML Fundamentals"},{"text":"Security Awareness"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Statistics & Computer Science / Mathematics & Computing Graduate","Software Development Intern","Junior Software Developer","Software Developer","Software Engineer","Senior Software Engineer","Staff/Principal Engineer or Engineering Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"The degree is particularly valuable because it combines computing with mathematics and statistics. To convert that academic advantage into a software-development career, the student should prioritise strong programming + DSA + software engineering + databases + backend development + cloud + real production projects."}]}]}